ind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 7","summary":"Good-day EmployeesAngela here. We are losing control of the office. All the interns have gone ballistic the moment the event counter ticked over. We are in critical failure mode and must liquidate the current workforce. We are in a full 6-7 meltdown.On a bright side, the coffee is really good today.-AngelaIn case you missed the previous announcements, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recreation of an office in-engine an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042573","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1847286114040323","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 6","summary":"Good-day EmployeesGood-dae. Robby hear to saye, Angela asked Robby to fix company spelling servers agane. I dont know how. Please no ask me again. I make coffee and coffee. Nothing Ls.-Robby.In case you missed the previous announcements, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recreation of an office in-engine and it's your job to guess where it's from. A winner will be drawn from correct answers from each day. Follow to keep ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T18:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040323","verified_at":"2026-10-24T23:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1847286114037459","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 5","summary":"Good-day EmployeesGood job on the last one. Also please disregard the previously undiscovered typos. Our spellcheck micro-services have been effected by an outage caused by the previous IT lead spilling her coffee on our internal servers. She was promptly replaced with a Robby, our all-new AI powered coffee maker (he doesn't brew anything, he just presses the button on the coffee brewer. We needed to utilize him more anyway).-Angela\"Robby wants to be a reel boy\" -RobbyIn case you missed the prev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037459","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:41:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1847286114033744","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 4","summary":"Good-day EmployeesHappy Mid-Fest! 2 of the prizes have been won so far. Please look out for incoming keys after the festival and while you're at it, please avoid any incoming phishing links. I was already annoyed with the use of 6-7 around the office. I do not appreciate being told 4 when ever I ask about our security health.-AngelaIn case you missed the previous announcements, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recreatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033744","verified_at":"2026-10-22T21:58:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1847286114029861","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 3","summary":"Good-day EmployeesIn case you missed the previous announcements, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recreation of an office in-engine and it's your job to guess where it's from. A winner will be drawn from correct answers from each day.Day 3Remember to send all guesses to NextFestQuiz@intrusivethoughtgaming.com. Posting in the discussions board will not count.Put \"Office TD Office Quiz 3\" in the subject line and put your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029861","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:58:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1846651706696276","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 2","summary":"Good-day EmployeesAs of writing this, I have not noticed any team players that have been able to identify the previously posted image. I will update our internal performance records accordingly and ask that we treat this exercise with all the love in our heart for this company and our fellow employees; Just like the family we are.-AngelaIn case you missed the previous announcements, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696276","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:09:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1846651706692011","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Giveway: Office Layout 1","summary":"Good-day EmployeesAs part of a team building exercise, we will be showing various office layouts and it is up to you to guess what they're from. Participation is mandatory.-AngelaIn case you missed the previous announcement, we are doing a giveaway for Office TD keys every day of steam NEXT FEST. We are going to post an attempt at a recreation of an office in-engine and it's your job to guess where it's from. A winner will be drawn from correct answers from each day.Day 1Remember to send all gue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:00:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692011","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1846651706688864","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD - Steam NEXT FEST Giveaway","summary":"Good-day EmployeesWe will be doing a key giveaway every day of Steam NEXT FEST!Every day @ 10:00 Pacific Time we will be posting a picture of an office layout made in our level editor and it will be your job to identify where it's from. You will need to send in your guess and your steam id to an event email. We will do a drawing from the correct answers each day for the winner of that day. Winners will get a key to the final release of the game!Follow to be ready to answer when we go live!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:18:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688864","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1846651706684849","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"update","title":"Demo Small Update","summary":"Good morning,It has come to my attention that adjustable key bindings have long since been absent from our high-performance pipeline. To facilitate faster development times, we have generously provided the ability to alter key bindings within the options menu. Please record your use and submit with your timecard to allow for adequate runway for financials to adjust our monthly budget. Just like a family, if the household budget is not maintained you will be homeless eventually.Sincerely,AngelaDe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:37:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1846018067942679","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD - Demo Released","summary":"The Office TD Demo is available now!The demo featuresTutorialFirst 5 levels3 Employee towers4 Equipment towers3 Active abilities5 basic enemy typesNew addition to the demo is the Broken Fan:Utilize the broken fan to inflict a nice constant annoying line of discomfort to unsuspecting coworkers!Compete with your friends to see how far you can get and share your builds and feedback, we'd love to hear it!Please feel free to utilize the in-game feedback tool if there are any bugs or you have feedback","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1841579228671914","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office TD Playtest Demo!","summary":"GreetingsI hope you're excited to get a hands on experience with Office Tower Defense. We are pleased to announce the playtest demo is available now!The demo features Tutorial5 Levels of various layouts3 Employee towers3 Equipment towers3 Active abilities5 basic enemy typesCompete with your friends to see how far you can get and share your builds and feedback, we'd love to hear it!(we are currently looking into options for more streamlined feedback, currently you can use this announcement to lea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T18:07:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809720-1840944183775641","game_id":"steam-4809720","kind":"announcement","title":"Office Tower Defense Announcement","summary":"GreetingsIntrusive Thought Gaming LLC is proud to announce our first game:Office Tower Defense!Office TD is a maze building tower-defense game set in a highly dysfunctional office. Utilize your lovable but incompetent co-workers and \"reliable\" office equipment to foil middle-management from distracting you from finishing the project. Manage funds and awards to improve your roster of new hires and acquisitions.We are slated for a end of year launch; in the meantime, look forward to our demo and o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T03:49:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775641","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4809720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4809720":"2026-10-26T14:29:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4809720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:05Z"},"5118080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:06Z"}},"cont